WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.749
Stage 1 is your business identity and approved knowledge.

00:00:03.749 --> 00:00:11.766
Enter your website address and Concierge scans your public pages, your logo, your brand colour and your country timezone.

00:00:11.766 --> 00:00:18.770
Add plain notes for anything your site does not say, like call-out fees, service areas or policies.

00:00:18.770 --> 00:00:23.140
A built-in price check means Concierge never invents a quote.

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:28.340
If an answer is not there, it says so and offers to pass the question to you.

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:36.275
Then use the sandbox test chat to ask real customer questions in dry-run mode, before anything goes live.
